### LAB 3: REST API, QUERY PARAMETERS, VALIDATION & DEBUGGING
### Student: SYED ISRAR HUSSAIN | Reg No: 252U1R1235 | Section: CSE-2E
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root / Directory Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. GET All Books (Default Limit=10, Offset=0, Order=id ASC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/

### 3. GET Search Books by Title (search_q=JavaScript)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=JavaScript

### 4. GET Sort Books by Price Descending (order_by=price&order=DESC)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC

### 5. GET Pagination (limit=3&offset=3)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?limit=3&offset=3

### 6. GET Price Range Filter (min_price=400&max_price=800)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?min_price=400&max_price=800

### 7. GET Combined Query Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?search_q=the&min_price=200&max_price=900&order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=4&offset=0

### 8. GET Single Book by ID (ID 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1/

### 9. POST Add New Book (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "System Design Interview",
  "author": "Alex Xu",
  "price": 850,
  "pages": 300
}

### 10. PUT Update Existing Book (ID 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Pragmatic Programmer (20th Anniversary Edition)",
  "author": "David Thomas, Andrew Hunt",
  "price": 799,
  "pages": 360
}

### 11. DELETE Book by ID (ID 15)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/books/15/

### 12. Validation Test: Missing Title on POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 300
}

### 13. Validation Test: Missing Author on POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "price": 500,
  "pages": 300
}

### 14. Validation Test: Negative Price on POST
POST {{baseUrl}}/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Invalid Price Book",
  "author": "Unknown Author",
  "price": -100,
  "pages": 200
}

### 15. Validation Test: Invalid order_by Field
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order_by=invalid_column

### 16. Validation Test: Invalid order Sort Direction
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?order=DIAGONAL

### 17. Validation Test: Negative limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/?limit=-5

### 18. Validation Test: Non-numeric ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/abc/

### 19. 404 Test: Non-existent ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/999/

### 20. 404 Test: Unknown Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown-api-route/

